# Anti AI-slop
Do not default to:
- gratuitous bento grids;
- glassmorphism;
- neon/glow/orb/mesh backgrounds;
- all-sections-as-rounded-cards;
- random abstract 3D objects;
- generic stock psychology imagery;
- excessive gradients;
- oversized empty hero text with no content hierarchy;
- generic motivational copy.

Every decorative element must come from the brand system or solve a real hierarchy/interaction problem.
Before adding a trendy component, explain internally what job it performs. If there is no job, do not add it.
